# prompt: firework burst with a crackle tail
# tags: firework, burst, crackle, festive
# The tail is the point: a firework is a short report followed by most of a
# second of individual crackles, so the grain layer opens 150 ms late and
# outlives everything else in the sound.
sound "firework" 1060ms explosion
  burst: noise white >> hp ~1800Hz[800..4000] | gain 0.38 decay 120ms
  boom: sub ~110Hz[60..200] -> 45Hz in 180ms | gain 0.34 attack 3ms decay 380ms
  crackle: grains ~2800Hz[1200..6000] rate ~220[80..500] width 2ms spread 3 bend 1 | gain 0.3 attack 40ms decay 800ms delay 150ms
